# No agent co-authors

Never add Cursor, Claude, Copilot, or any AI agent as a co-author, author, committer, or trailer on git commits, pull requests, or changelogs.

- Do not include `Co-authored-by:` (or similar) trailers for agents or tools
- If a hook or tool inserts an agent co-author, strip it before finishing (rewrite the commit without that trailer)
- Commits and PRs must be attributed only to the human user / their configured git identity
